{
  "_comment": "Maps textures in the player's own Beta 1.7.3 client jar onto 26.3 texture paths (under assets/minecraft/textures/). Atlas tiles are numbered left to right, top to bottom on a 16x16 grid. Textures whose layout changed since Beta are rebuilt: chests and the inventory screen are composed from parts (compose), beds and redstone dust are turned to fit (a target ending in |rot90 or |flipx), and leather and water have the colour 26.3 tints them with divided out (|untint). Beta drew water, lava, fire and the portal with code; effects runs ports of that code and records the animation. A file's optional transform is legacy_skin (convert a 64x32 skin the way vanilla does) or over_modern (draw onto the top of the modern 64x64 texture, keeping its extra bottom half).",
